# Docker build context filter: an allowlist. Every image builds from the
# repository root, and only what the Rust workspace build needs enters the
# context, so build/, .mintswarm/, web/ and .git never do.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!.cargo/config.toml
!crates/
!api/proto/
**/build
**/target
**/node_modules
